sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Edge as Edge Agent
    participant LB as Ingress / LB
    participant API as API Pod (stateless)
    participant Tenancy as tenancy module
    participant Parking as parking module
    participant Outbox as events (outbox)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant WS as WebApp (STOMP client)

    Edge->>LB: POST /api/v1/ingest/events (X-Gate-Key, eventId, JWT-less)
    LB->>API: route (round-robin, no sticky session)
    API->>Tenancy: resolve tenant_id/site_id (gate/camera lookup)
    Tenancy->>API: tenant context (RLS session var set)
    API->>Parking: validate + apply domain rule (e.g. VehicleEntered)
    Parking->>PG: BEGIN, upsert Vehicle/ParkingEvent, write outbox row, COMMIT
    PG-->>Parking: ok
    Parking->>Outbox: notify relay (polling/CDC)
    Outbox->>MQ: publish ParkingEvent (routing key tenant.site.eventType)
    API-->>Edge: 200 OK {eventId, status: accepted}

    MQ->>API: consume (notification module, separate consumer group)
    API->>Redis: PUBLISH topic tenant:{id}:site:{id}:vehicle-check
    Redis-->>API: fan-out to subscribed pods
    API->>WS: STOMP MESSAGE /topic/gate/{gateId}/check
    WS-->>WS: render live update, no page reload

    Note over Edge,PG: If ingest fails (network/5xx), Edge retries from<br/>local SQLite queue with exponential backoff, dedup by eventId.
